{"created": "2023-04-11T16:26:27.137310+00:00", "modified": "2023-04-12T14:26:46.056773+00:00", "id": 7566042, "conceptrecid": "7566041", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7566042", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.7566041", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7566042", "metadata": {"title": "Mount Holyoke College Laser Induced Breakdown Spectra; SuperLIBS 10K; Mars analog atmosphere", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7566042", "publication_date": "2023-01-31", "description": "<p>Laser induced breakdown spectra of reference targets with known composition. Spectra were acquired on the SuperLIBS instrument at Mount Holyoke College under a Mars-like atmosphere at laser energies of 2.4 mJ, 4.0 mJ, 5.6 mJ, and 7.2 mJ. Processing includes baseline removal (airPLS) and normalization within each spectral region (UV, VIS, and VIS-NIR). This is a subset of a larger LIBS reference database that will be available on the NASA PDS Geosciences node at:&nbsp;https://doi.org/10.17189/b2aj-cz96. This research was supported by NASA grant 80NSSC21K0888.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Lepore, K. H.", "affiliation": "Mount Holyoke College", "orcid": "0000-0001-8983-6880"}, {"name": "Dyar, M. D.", "affiliation": "Mount Holyoke College", "orcid": "0000-0003-4272-793X"}, {"name": "Ytsma, C. R.", "affiliation": "Cai Consulting", "orcid": "0000-0002-8333-6428"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "7566041"}}]}}, "title": "Mount Holyoke College Laser Induced Breakdown Spectra; SuperLIBS 10K; Mars analog atmosphere", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7566042", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7566042", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7566042?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7566042", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7566042", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.52